        """Parse a string representation back into the Vector.

        >>> Vectors.parse('[2,1,2 ]')
        DenseVector([2.0, 1.0, 2.0])
        >>> Vectors.parse(' ( 100,  [0],  [2])')
        SparseVector(100, {0: 2.0})
