choose the correct set at runtime (see Builder docs above):

let ffo = new firefox.Options();
// Configure ...

let co = new chrome.Options();
// Configure ...

let driver = new Builder()
.setChromeOptions(co)
.setFirefoxOptions(ffo)
.build();

