Şu işi yapan bir fonksiyon yaz:

Internal function used by GammaCdf

@param x
@param A
@return

```java
protected static double Gcf(double x, double A)
    {
        // Good for X>A+1
        double A0 = 0;
        double B0 = 1;
        double A1 = 1;
        double B1 = x;
        double AOLD = 0;
        double N = 0;
        while (Math.abs((A1 - AOLD) / A1) > .00001)
        {
            AOLD = A1;
            N = N + 1;
            A0 = A1 + (N - A) * A0;
            B0 = B1 + (N - A) * B0;
            A1 = x * A0 + N * A1;
            B1 = x * B0 + N * B1;
            A0 = A0 / B1;
            B0 = B0 / B1;
            A1 = A1 / B1;
            B1 = 1;
        }
        double Prob = Math.exp(A * Math.log(x) - x - LogGamma(A)) * A1;

        return 1.0 - Prob;
    }
```

